   "en": "The mishna teaches that «the first group entered,» after which they closed the doors to the Temple courtyard. «It was stated» that the amora’im disagreed about the precise wording of the mishna. «Abaye said: We learned» in the mishna that the doors of the Temple courtyard miraculously «closed by themselves. Rava said: We learned» in the mishna «that» people «would close» the doors of the Temple courtyard at the appropriate time."
